            "id": "c2fbfcc2-594b-368a-a94e-c978989b5171",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Freelancers with AI skills likely to earn higher premiums: Upwork CEO",
            "description": "<p>Upwork (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UPWK\">UPWK</a>) CEO Hayden Brown sits down with Yahoo Finance executive editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\">Brian Sozzi</a> to discuss the advantages freelancers can have by learning skills pertaining to AI.</p>\n<p>Catch Hayden Brown also comment on <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/freelance-economy-actually-flourishing-ai-173000206.html\">the growth in the contingent and freelance labor markets</a> amid the rise in artificial intelligence adoption.</p>\n<p>Also watch the Wall Street Journal's Greg Ip explain to Yahoo Finance why people are <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/ai-supposed-things-easier-why-173000166.html\">still uncomfortable with AI.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\">Opening Bid</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Upwork (UPWK) CEO Hayden Brown sits down with Yahoo Finance executive editor Brian Sozzi to discuss the advantages freelancers can have by learning skills pertaining to AI. Catch Hayden Brown also comment on the growth in the contingent and freelance labor markets amid the rise in artificial intelligence adoption. Also watch the Wall Street Journal's Greg Ip explain to Yahoo Finance why people are still uncomfortable with AI. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Opening Bid.",
