        {
          "id": "cf6ed8b3-b5c1-3fba-a06d-e6a505f981ec",
          "content": {
            "id": "cf6ed8b3-b5c1-3fba-a06d-e6a505f981ec",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "AI to reshape job market: What skills set you apart in an AI world?",
            "description": "<p>Artificial intelligence (AI) is expected to reshape the labor market, replacing some human workers and augmenting others. LinkedIn newsletter writer Andrew McCaskill joins Asking for a Trend to discuss how to leverage the skills AI can't replicate to secure your role.</p>\n<p>Earlier this week, Upwork (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UPWK\">UPWK</a>) CEO Hayden Brown explained how <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/freelance-economy-actually-flourishing-ai-173000206.html\">the contingent and freelance labor markets have been flourishing</a> amid the rise in AI adoption. Also, catch Wall Street Journal's Greg Ip explain to Yahoo Finance why people are <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/ai-supposed-things-easier-why-173000166.html\">still uncomfortable with AI.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/asking-for-a-trend/\">Asking for a Trend</a>.</p>",
